WEBVTT

00:01:29.929 --> 00:01:31.080
AG: Oh my gosh.

00:01:31.104 --> 00:01:32.686
MA: Yeah, it was very bad.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.666
I won't do it again soon.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.426
AG: But here's the thing.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:39.006
Despite being a world-class
procrastinator,

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.966
Margaret does not turn
manuscripts in late.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.546
MA: No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:45.396
I do not miss deadlines.

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.966
I would consider it
dishonorable to miss a deadline.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:52.926
AG: How does she manage
her procrastination so productively?

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.125
And can you?

00:01:54.149 --> 00:02:01.149
(Music)